# Transient File Reader
#  For specifying the FMP Semi-Routed Delivery (SRD) Upper Limit for removing water.
#
# Each uncommented line uses the Universal Loader (ULOAD) to read NSFR_DELIV upper limits
# 
# In this example, since there is only 1 SRD, 
#   ULOAD uses an implied internal read (no read directive present, like INTERNAL or OPEN/CLOSE)
#   To read the input along each line.
#   This makes it easy to specify the upper limit on each line
